  "sourceTitle": "Build self-improving document processing using Amazon Bedrock AgentCore",
  "sourceBodyHash": "7bb45a2469028c2c07aaa40d3c9cf2835c1a0881b0e320439d8e975569311969",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
  "status": "complete",
  "importanceLevel": 5,
  "provider": "nowcoding",
  "requestedModel": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-14T17:42:27.136744Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-14T17:47:58.758704Z",
  "totalBlocks": 104,
  "translatedBlocks": 104,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "996deaafefdd0520",
      "translationZh": "IDC 研究表明，与文档相关的挑战每年使组织为每位信息工作者承担 19,732 的成本，并使生产力下降 21.3%。接收数百家供应商发票的组织，经常面临因开票方而异、且会在不事先通知的情况下发生变化的版式。在这样的规模下，基于模板的系统需要持续维护。员工可能将多达 30% 的时间花在文档相关任务上，而手动数据录入的错误率在 1–4% 之间。传统的智能文档处理（IDP）解决方案能够减轻其中一部分负担，但需要预先针对每种文档格式进行大量配置，而且当不同供应商的版式不一致时就会失效。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "97287aa34634598b",
      "translationZh": "在本文中，你将了解如何使用 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 构建一个智能体式 IDP 系统，以极少的人工干预对业务文档进行分类、提取、验证，并从中学习。Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 是一个可使用任意框架或模型，大规模构建、连接和优化智能体的平台。你的智能体会自动处理新的文档格式，例如供应商发票、采购订单、保险索赔申请和贷款申请。读完本文后，你将能够：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "241c5a08779dce49",
      "translationZh": "部署一个多智能体 IDP 系统，通常用时不到 20 分钟。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "24925d92a20b7af9",
      "translationZh": "无需手动配置模板即可处理新的文档类型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "041091808c8d2549",
      "translationZh": "让智能体针对每种新的文档格式自行训练，并复用所学内容，使后续同类型文档直接进入提取流程，无需重新训练。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "6833ab3243c55079",
      "translationZh": "基于规则的文档处理所面临的挑战",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6f3b38f3e6c401b7",
      "translationZh": "许多 IDP 流水线要求你预先为每种文档格式定义模板、提取规则和验证逻辑。当新供应商发送版式不同的采购订单时，流水线就会失效。这带来了三个核心挑战：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ea64499a7bdf62d0",
      "translationZh": "模板僵化：每种新的文档格式都需要手动配置，即使是细微的版式变化也可能导致提取失败。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0ceed90cc943f927",
      "translationZh": "无法学习：由于系统不会保留从以往修正中获得的知识，相同的提取错误会在类似文档中反复出现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c93ec2327b73a10f",
      "translationZh": "扩展负担：每增加一个供应商或一种文档变体，维护工作量都会成倍增加，而处理来自数百个来源的文档的组织则面临持续的运营成本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "73647b95ae4ba5d0",
      "translationZh": "智能体式方法可以应对这些挑战。AI 智能体不再使用静态模板，而是分析每份文档、生成提取指令、验证结果，并自动从修正中学习。随着时间的推移，您的系统会建立一个文档格式知识库，从而只需极少的额外配置即可处理类似文档。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6eeea36bfcbaece3",
      "translationZh": "在此解决方案中，八个专门的智能体在运行于 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 上的两个基于图的工作流中协作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7c474868ac66d4f3",
      "translationZh": "下图展示了使用 Strands Agents 构建的多智能体工作流图。Strands Agents 是一个用于构建 AI 智能体的开源 SDK。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6bfbe58e0ff36fdf",
      "translationZh": "图 1：多智能体编排工作流图",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "edae8b58e90f44da",
      "translationZh": "识别工作流：Analyzer 智能体使用 Amazon Textract 提取文本，并识别文档类型和发送方。Matcher 智能体使用 Amazon S3 Vectors 中的向量相似度来搜索类似文档，Amazon S3 Vectors 是 Amazon Simple Storage Service (Amazon S3) 的一项功能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e45858f525dd388d",
      "translationZh": "训练工作流（新文档类型）：当未找到匹配项时，Instructions 智能体生成提取提示词，Extractor 智能体提取结构化数据，Validator 智能体则依据 Amazon Aurora DSQL 中的模式和业务规则检查结果。如果验证失败，Instructions Fixer 智能体会改进提示词并重试。成功后，Save Instructions 智能体会持久化保存指令，以供复用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "12ffb5b87463b489",
      "translationZh": "自动化工作流（已知文档类型）：找到匹配项后，Extractor 智能体会使用现有指令。如果验证失败，Troubleshooter 智能体会直接修正提取的数据，而不修改指令。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a10ef5d05aa1ba40",
      "translationZh": "下图展示了该解决方案的基础设施架构。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "42a21b76b8ee7cec",
      "translationZh": "图 2：AWS 上的智能体式 IDP 基础设施架构",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "15083b1f6ce83634",
      "translationZh": "业务文档通过 Amazon Simple Email Service (Amazon SES) 接收，或直接上传到 Amazon S3。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "88a25a7f5295726e",
      "translationZh": "Amazon EventBridge 触发一个 AWS Lambda 函数，该函数在 Amazon DynamoDB 中创建跟踪任务，并调用 AgentCore runtime，后者是 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 的一项功能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f4b8289454c2daea",
      "translationZh": "AgentCore runtime 通过 Strands Agents 编排文档处理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8cb078e59fedde37",
      "translationZh": "您的智能体通过机器对机器凭证安全地访问 AWS 资源，这些凭证由 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 的一项功能 AgentCore Identity 以及 Amazon Cognito 管理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "54b41ea814da329d",
      "translationZh": "您的 Lambda 函数通过 AgentCore Gateway 的 Model Context Protocol (MCP) 接口成为与智能体兼容的工具；AgentCore Gateway 是 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 的一项功能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "af330bb77fa6cc7a",
      "translationZh": "智能体使用 Amazon Textract 提取文本，使用 S3 Vectors 中的向量嵌入对文档进行分类，并依据 Aurora DSQL 中的业务规则验证数据。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a723b6ccf3236576",
      "translationZh": "智能体通过 MCP 服务器访问企业数据，以依据业务规则验证提取的内容。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5f0cb89ed79234cb",
      "translationZh": "您可以通过托管在 Amazon Elastic Container Service (Amazon ECS) 上、支持聊天功能的仪表板监控状态并排查问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f560bc177f08adc7",
      "translationZh": "您可以通过 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 的一项功能 AgentCore Observability，以及 Amazon CloudWatch 遥测数据，了解智能体的性能表现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aa332798bcc27f5a",
      "translationZh": "按照以下步骤，将解决方案的基础设施和 Web UI 部署到您的 AWS 账户。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6cb09dbf7313f15b",
      "translationZh": "要部署此解决方案，您必须具备：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d726e31ad391086d",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Bedrock 的访问权限，且已启用 Amazon Nova 和 Anthropic (Claude) 模型。有关各 AWS Region 的模型可用性，请参阅“Amazon Bedrock 中按 AWS Region 列出的受支持模型”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d593d52c66f5f42f",
      "translationZh": "在受支持的 Region 中访问 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore (Runtime, Gateway, Identity)、S3 Vectors 和 Amazon Aurora DSQL 的权限。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "35fde357aae02da8",
      "translationZh": "已安装 AWS Cloud Development Kit (AWS CDK) v2。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5d6015ef520a1dc2",
      "translationZh": "已安装并运行 Docker（构建和部署容器镜像所必需）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fb16e495d1447e2c",
      "translationZh": "Python 3.11+ 和 Node.js 18+。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "952fc1a0bfcd9abc",
      "translationZh": "具备 AWS Identity and Access Management (IAM) 权限，可创建 S3 存储桶、Lambda 函数、DynamoDB 表、Cognito 用户池、Amazon Elastic Container Registry (Amazon ECR) 仓库和 Amazon ECS 服务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "82ef83e10645482b",
      "translationZh": "克隆仓库并设置环境：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f357ccc2c9b4ad9d",
      "translationZh": "这将部署六个 AWS CloudFormation 堆栈：Core（S3、Cognito、DynamoDB）、Gateway（Lambda 工具、AgentCore Gateway）、Aurora（Amazon Aurora DSQL）、Agent（AgentCore 运行时、容器）、UI Orchestrator（API 端点）和 Modern UI（托管在 Amazon CloudFront 上的 React 应用）。部署大约需要 15–20 分钟。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "73ee5a93342ae320",
      "translationZh": "检查 CloudFormation 控制台中的每个堆栈是否都显示 CREATE_COMPLETE，以验证部署。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "24ddaf635d4cc6b9",
      "translationZh": "处理文件并查看结果",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "49f07bdda15e91df",
      "translationZh": "部署完成后，你会收到一封电子邮件，其中包含 CloudFront URL、用户名和临时密码。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8768985c940d400f",
      "translationZh": "从 infrastructure/sample_data/purchase_orders/training/ 上传一份示例采购订单。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3bd101270420febe",
      "translationZh": "文档进入智能体工作流：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "dc3279af095f6bea",
      "translationZh": "Analyzer 智能体提取文本，并识别发送方和文档类型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3d445eeb8d637abd",
      "translationZh": "Matcher 智能体在向量存储中搜索相似文档。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7833979e74519077",
      "translationZh": "对于新的文档类型，训练工作流会生成提取指令、提取数据、验证数据，并保存这些指令以供日后使用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "16ca226d60a49d4b",
      "translationZh": "对于已知的文档类型，自动化工作流使用现有指令提取数据并进行验证。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "81dc8c3904005ae4",
      "translationZh": "在 Review Jobs and Instructions 选项卡中查看结果，以核实提取的数据、验证结果和生成的指令。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "21f3d31e631b1f3c",
      "translationZh": "示例：新的文档类型（训练工作流）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "003a74f265d58cf5",
      "translationZh": "假设你上传了来自新零售商 Two Wheel Store 的第一份采购订单。Matcher 智能体搜索向量存储，未找到类似文档，于是将任务转入训练工作流。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9149a03fd5915e41",
      "translationZh": "Analyzer 智能体使用 Amazon Textract 提取文档原始文本：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d6e9796522dfdc3b",
      "translationZh": "Instructions 智能体根据模式生成提取提示词，Extractor 智能体则生成结构化 JSON：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f31dfa7842a94602",
      "translationZh": "Validator 智能体依据模式检查结果，但验证未通过：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3706e2199e393c2c",
      "translationZh": "供应商的 SKU 格式（SB-004）与 Acme Bikes 的内部格式（AB-SB-004）不匹配。Instructions Fixer 智能体诊断出这一不匹配问题，并在提取提示词中添加一条明确的 SKU 转换规则：为供应商的 SKU 添加前缀 AB-。第二轮处理时，七个行项目均成功通过验证，Save Instructions 智能体将优化后的提示词持久化保存到向量存储中。此次首次运行的端到端耗时为：3 分 49 秒。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b402155cfc4b398d",
      "translationZh": "示例：已知的文档类型（自动化工作流）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "17a03a273904c640",
      "translationZh": "当来自 Two Wheel Store 的第二份采购订单到达时，Matcher 智能体找到首次运行时存储的指令，置信度分数为 3.946（阈值：3.7），并将任务转入自动化工作流：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9e8938143181b190",
      "translationZh": "Extractor 智能体直接应用已存储的指令，因此编排器会跳过提示词生成。在训练期间学到的 SKU 转换规则会自动应用（ EL-002 → AB-EL-002 , HB-071 → AB-HB-071 , PD-002 → AB-PD-002 ）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "50a6ed734523e9d7",
      "translationZh": "这 3 个订单行项目在首次校验时即通过，订单总额为 5,979.19。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ba505f3e7d5db5ba",
      "translationZh": "端到端处理在 1 分钟 30 秒内完成，比首次运行的 3 分钟 49 秒有所缩短。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "cda7f95cca4b63e0",
      "translationZh": "使用交互式聊天",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "12ea3384fb9abf67",
      "translationZh": "仪表板提供了用于故障排查的聊天界面：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d5cca6d42b76b67a",
      "translationZh": "询问“what tools do you have”，以查看可用的智能体能力。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ceaa2c079359be4c",
      "translationZh": "询问“list instructions”，以查看已存储的提取指令。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "00efc6963df0caf8",
      "translationZh": "询问“what is the status of job XXXX”，以检查处理进度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "43baab60ff51505f",
      "translationZh": "询问“任务 XXXX 出了什么问题，我们该如何更新指令？”以诊断失败原因。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0fc8c1400f0e54ed",
      "translationZh": "了解准确率如何随时间提高",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7be8a1b87d8c04d3",
      "translationZh": "系统通过两个反馈循环随时间不断改进：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c7975f9a3d5b0f99",
      "translationZh": "训练循环：当 Instructions Fixer 智能体在验证失败后优化提取提示词时，改进后的指令会被保存，并在处理类似文档时重复使用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "451d2b8f8fc2f4f3",
      "translationZh": "处理循环：当 Troubleshooter 智能体修复提取错误时，它会提供详细分析，帮助识别文档格式变化中的规律。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "163c4a1fb73dc44e",
      "translationZh": "更换模型时，请使用 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 的一项功能 AgentCore Evaluations，确认提取质量仍处于可接受的水平。该解决方案已经使用 AgentCore Observability，因此具备所需的检测与监测机制。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b38d15b904375e09",
      "translationZh": "您只需为实际使用的资源付费，因为该解决方案运行在无服务器和按需资源上，不产生闲置成本。对于在美国东部（弗吉尼亚北部）每月包含 10 份训练文档和 1,000 份处理文档的工作负载，估算成本约为每月 58。通过 Amazon Bedrock 进行的基础模型（FM）推理约占总成本的 85%，每份文档约为 0.055。实际成本主要取决于分配给各个智能体的模型。模型选择集中在 agents/orchestratorgraph/utils/config.py 中，因此您可以为较简单的任务使用成本较低的模型，并在需要时使用能力更强的模型。有关详细定价，请参阅 Amazon Bedrock 定价页面。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f6a40191b02ee2e3",
      "translationZh": "根据您的使用场景定制解决方案",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1e26fc56764f7872",
      "translationZh": "你将获得一个采购订单处理用例，其中包含一家虚构自行车公司的合成数据集、预先构建的 JSON 模式，以及一个用于验证的 Lambda 函数，该函数会将提取的数据与模拟 ERP 数据库中的产品和供应商记录进行核对。要处理自己的文档，你必须将随附的模式和验证逻辑替换为自己的模式和验证逻辑。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fbcc2537de389d56",
      "translationZh": "定义文档模式",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ffb2a7e3d421aeef",
      "translationZh": "创建一个 JSON 模式，定义你希望从每种文档类型中提取的字段。agents/orchestratorgraph/doc_schema/purchase_order_schema.json 中的采购订单示例模式可供参考。你的模式应指定字段名称、数据类型，以及每个字段是在文档中明确陈述的，还是根据上下文推断得出的。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c43a482e25f41106",
      "translationZh": "构建验证流程",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "15967bf08b4c1754",
      "translationZh": "随附的验证器会将采购订单数据与 Aurora DSQL 中的合成供应商表和产品表进行核对。你的生产环境实现需要一个根据业务规则定制的验证流程。例如：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "462e82f1959e5c25",
      "translationZh": "发票验证器可以将供应商 ID 与应付账款系统中的记录进行核对，并验证各明细项金额的合计是否与发票总额一致。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "475efb620d2bdc94",
      "translationZh": "合同验证器可以验证文档是否包含必需的条款，以及日期和当事方名称是否与你的记录一致。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "31859de1c703f8c0",
      "translationZh": "理赔验证器可以将保单号、承保限额和索赔人信息与保单管理系统中的记录进行核对。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d15d2a10604b8c98",
      "translationZh": "要添加新的验证器，请创建一个 Lambda 函数，使其接收提取出的 JSON，并返回通过或失败的结果以及详细的错误消息，然后将其注册为 AgentCore Gateway 中的工具。有关实现模式，请参阅 gateway/tools/po_validator_tool/。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1926941807ac7df8",
      "translationZh": "更新智能体提示词",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "df320a6d2b174f35",
      "translationZh": "agents/orchestratorgraph/prompts/ 中的智能体提示词引用了采购订单术语。请更新这些提示词，以反映你的文档类型和提取要求。Orchestrator 智能体、Validator 智能体和 Instructions 智能体各自都包含针对特定文档类型的表述，你应对其进行调整。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3945dec88f72b8f4",
      "translationZh": "在训练和运行基于智能体的 IDP 系统时，请牢记以下建议。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "21ef1d14559fa14f",
      "translationZh": "从有代表性的样本开始：训练期间，每种类型上传 5–10 份文档，其中应包括存在格式变化的边界情况，以构建可靠的提取指令。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "521f5adf64583445",
      "translationZh": "使用业务规则验证：将验证器连接到 Aurora DSQL 中的参考数据（供应商列表、产品目录），以便尽早发现提取错误。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "00ffe9037e6544e6",
      "translationZh": "监控智能体性能：使用 AgentCore Observability 和 CloudWatch 跟踪执行路径、识别瓶颈，并衡量提取准确率随时间的变化。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b5b80a24548ea232",
      "translationZh": "逐步添加文档类型：为每种新的文档类型创建一个 JSON 模式和相应的验证 Lambda 函数。其余工作由智能体处理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c5f72cc01aae4634",
      "translationZh": "为生产环境添加防护措施：应用 Amazon Bedrock Guardrails，对智能体输出执行内容过滤和依据核查。在处理保险理赔或贷款申请等敏感文档类型时，这一点尤其重要。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "553cfea97976475e",
      "translationZh": "查阅 OWASP 大语言模型十大安全风险：构建使用大语言模型（LLMs）的应用程序时，请参考《OWASP 大语言模型与生成式 AI 应用十大安全风险》，了解安全注意事项。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d970eecd0d44ac50",
      "translationZh": "重要提示：执行清理前，请导出您想要保留的数据。destroy.py 脚本会永久删除已处理的文档（S3）、作业历史记录（DynamoDB）、验证数据（Aurora DSQL）以及学习到的提取指令（向量存储）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "03ca3bc02bcb1c96",
      "translationZh": "为避免持续产生费用，请移除已部署的资源：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4d174b6b2c392913",
      "translationZh": "在控制台中确认以下六个 CloudFormation 堆栈均已删除：AgenticIDP-Core-Dev、AgenticIDP-Gateway-Dev、AgenticIDP-Aurora-Dev、AgenticIDP-Agent-Dev、AgenticIDP-UIOrchestr-Dev 和 AgenticIDP-ModernUI-Dev。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7fb8a27eb855306c",
      "translationZh": "在本文中，您了解了如何使用 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 构建一个能够自我改进的文档处理系统，其中各司其职的 AI 智能体协作，对业务文档进行分类、提取、验证，并从中学习。这种智能体式方法能够自动适应新的文档格式，并通过反馈循环不断提高准确性，以自主学习取代手动模板配置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "789e83d497e1091d",
      "translationZh": "部署示例解决方案，并使用随附的采购订单样本进行测试。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0096",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "45b4377c2346a93e",
      "translationZh": "通过创建 JSON 模式和验证规则，添加您自己的文档类型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0097",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "56975ac87a73118a",
      "translationZh": "探索如何将提取的数据与 ERP、CRM 或内容管理工具等下游系统集成。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b515247e1bdac2ae",
      "translationZh": "要进一步了解本文使用的服务和模式，请参阅以下资源：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0099",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5a7be9adfc189f20",
      "translationZh": "要深入了解本解决方案使用的智能体框架，请参阅《Strands Agents SDK：深入剖析智能体架构与可观测性》。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0100",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7c8f1ab482d4f01e",
      "translationZh": "要了解 AgentCore Gateway 如何将 API 转换为智能体兼容的工具，请参阅《Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Gateway 简介：变革企业 AI 智能体工具开发》。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0101",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "96de23f2e9f9715d",
      "translationZh": "要了解模型上下文协议及其与 AWS 服务集成的背景知识，请参阅《释放 AWS 上模型上下文协议（MCP）的强大能力》。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "80d12a845cc16f90",
      "translationZh": "要了解智能体如何跨会话保留上下文，请参阅《Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Memory：构建上下文感知智能体》。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0103",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "eff4b3f2e62bd60b",
      "translationZh": "有关 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 功能的详细信息，请参阅 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 文档。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0104",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6727257a62ceadfd",
      "translationZh": "如需有关构建文档处理解决方案的专家指导，AWS Professional Services 和 AWS Partners 可以提供帮助。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
  "wordWise": [
    {
